dium for the latest reporting year. productionsite_name is the site; pollutant the substance (e.g. NOX, CO2, CFCS); mediumcode AIR or WATER; totalpollutantquantitykg the yearly release; methodcode M measured, C calculated, E estimated. A site appears once per pollutant, so count sites by nationalid. Fields: name field productionsite_name, code field nationalid, class field mediumcode, activity field pollutant, date field year. 8,382 features. Completeness: complete (every Dutch site above the E-PRTR reporting thresholds, latest reporting year; smaller installations aren't in it). A curated record for Netherlands pollution screening (Tobler, 25 Nov 2026): the publisher's own service, checked to return lon/lat features for a bounding box.", 'licence': 'Public Domain Mark 1.0 (http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/), as stated in the Nationaal Georegister record', 'landing_page': 'https://data.rivm.nl/geo/inspire/wfs?service=WFS&request=GetCapabilities', 'bbox': [3.31, 50.75, 7.23, 53.56], 'geometry_type': 'point', 'concepts_hint': ['pollution-source', 'nl-pollution-pack'], 'endpoints': [{'protocol': 'wfs', 'url': 'https://data.rivm.nl/geo/inspire/wfs#inspire:facility_pollutant_release', 'service_url': 'https://data.rivm.nl/geo/inspire/wfs', 'capabilities': ['query', 'download'], 'info': {'type_name': 'inspire:facility_pollutant_release', 'output_formats': ['application/json'], 'name_field': 'productionsite_name', 'code_field': 'nationalid', 'class_field': 'mediumcode', 'activity_field': 'pollutant', 'date_field': 'year', 'class_values': ['AIR', 'WATER'], 'nation': 'Netherlands', 'completeness': 'complete', 'completeness_note': "every Dutch site above the E-PRTR reporting thresholds, latest reporting year; smaller installations aren't in it"}, 'check_url': 'https://data.rivm.nl/geo/inspire/wfs?service=WFS&version=1.1.0&request=GetFeature&typeName=inspire:facility_pollutant_release&resultType=hits'}, {'protocol': 'landing', 'url': 'https://data.rivm.nl/geo/in